{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22350","headline":"别杨颖士卢克柔殷尧藩 · 白居易","name":"别杨颖士卢克柔殷尧藩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倦鸟暮归林，浮云晴归山。\n独有行路子，悠悠不知还。\n人生苦营营，终日羣动间。\n所务虽不同，同归於不闲。\n扁舟来楚乡，匹马往秦关。\n离忧绕心曲，宛转如循环。\n且持一杯酒，聊以开愁颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}